    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23828" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκα-έτηρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ten-yearly</i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρόνος
			δ.</span> a space <i>of ten years.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				772b
			</span></i> codd.:— fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκα-ετηρὶς</span></b> 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανήγυρις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					57.24
				</span></i>
			: more freq. as Subst., <i>period of ten
			years,</i> prob. in Pl.l.c., Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				252.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				722
			</span></i> (Egypt, <span class="entity">iv A.D.</span>):— also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκα-ετηρία</span></b> , ἡ, title of Orphic work, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
